  "citation": "Hanson P J; Todd D E; Riggs J S; Wolfe M E; O'Neill E G (2001): Walker Branch Throughfall Displacement Experiment Data Report: Site Characterization, System Performance, Weather, Species Composition, and Growth (NDP-078 and 078A). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/VRC.NDP078",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
